Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,--Morning!\N--Good morning!\N--Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:03.98,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Class 2-4"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's been a while.\N--Happy new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido? Why are you spaced out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh. There's a lot on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits were humans in the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I know I was,\Nso I figured the others were, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.21,0:00:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Though now that Raziel's incomplete,\NI doubt I can look into it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.13,0:00:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I never could find out much\Nabout the Spirit of Origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Having said that,\Nmy power isn't completely gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll be able to hinder Westcott\Nfrom using Future Entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Artemisia Ashcroft is\Nthe British Anti-Spirit Team's ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as Wizards go,\Nshe's way better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I always thought she hated DEM,\Nso I wonder why she joined Westcott?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone had a wonderful break!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.63,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Today starts our third semester\Nin a brand new year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My birthday's not till March, though.\NHow old do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.77,0:01:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I refuse to turn "thirty,"\NI'm gonna call it "sirty."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.19,0:01:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.07,0:01:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Tammie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So now when you speak to me,\Nplease refer to me as "Sir."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.99,0:01:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sir! Yes, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.37,0:01:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! Did something happen, Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing much. Just my best friend\NEri deciding on her wedding date.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So happy for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet I'm still unclaimed. It seems\Nthe god of tying the knot hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's take attendance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:17.65,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Class 2-4"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.15,0:02:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,--Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!\N--Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! You're not okay, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! You need a break, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.78,0:02:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! That's so lame, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.87,0:02:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But if a demon appeared to grant\Na wish in exchange for my soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I might just say:\N"Send an asteroid at Japan, please!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.55,0:02:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Abracadabra! Drop on asteroid on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,--An asteroid?!\N--Did Tammie summon one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,--Tammie!\N--Tammie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, head to temp command.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's a Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.01,0:04:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're on standby like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.81,0:04:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Something fell in the schoolyard, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:05:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The same thing happened in\Nall of these locations simultaneously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Everywhere, simultaneously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,DEM and other country's\NAnti-Spirit Teams were hit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's possible they targeted\NSpirit power and magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Targeted? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's a Spirit\Nwe've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're giving her the code name, "Zodiac."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This video is from three hours ago.\NDEM discovered Zodiac first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We noticed odd movements from\NDEM ships and probed the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Westcott most likely found her\Nusing Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Though incomplete,\Nhe must have managed it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Segva.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.19,0:06:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's her Angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, "Michael."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Jabbing that key into things can lock\Nand close off their abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.17,0:06:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Lataib.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.06,0:07:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,An attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another of Michael's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The key is put into "space"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and opens up something\Nresembling a warp gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She's able to control\Nwhere the portals will exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! So the asteroid at school...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct. It's how Zodiac\Ncarried out her attack on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She opened up gates in space
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and tossed DEM ship debris through.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.39,0:07:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She was probably upset at being\Nwoken from her nice little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What will we do? Go to space?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.31,0:07:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.36,0:07:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a 3D projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.41,0:07:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If we project it into space\Nalong with a camera,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:08:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you can talk to her\Nlike you're actually there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, it's time for long-distance love\Nbetween Earth and space!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey. Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, help! My head! It's blown off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax! It's still attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down! I'm not an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about aggressive!\NI've died five times already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. I didn't think\Nshe would be this violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing\Nwe went with a projection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange. Why aren't you dead yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, we're talking.\NIt's 'cuz I'm being projected here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:09:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Projected? Hmm... That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you mind telling me your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mukuro. Mukuro Hoshimiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.65,0:09:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.82,OS,,0,0,0,,"1. I'm Shido Itsuka. Let's be friends."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:13.36,OS,,0,0,0,,"2. I'm Shido Itsuka. Let's be lovers."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:14.86,OS,,0,0,0,,"3. I'm Shido Itsuka, your future husband.\NI'm gonna make your body crave me."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:17.86,OS,,0,0,0,,"1. I'm Shido Itsuka. Let's be friends."\N"2. I'm Shido Itsuka. Let's be lovers."\N"3. I'm Shido Itsuka, your future husband. I'm gonna make your body crave me."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choices, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.24,0:09:22.87,OS,,0,0,0,,"1. I'm Shido Itsuka. Let's be friends."\N"2. I'm Shido Itsuka. Let's be lovers."\N"3. I'm Shido Itsuka, your future husband. I'm gonna make your body crave me."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. One and two work,\Nbut let's go on the offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.17,0:09:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't seen her happiness\Nmove either way yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get a reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.34,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, do three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Three?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens,\Nit's not like you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanna see what sort of\Nreaction it gets. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.73,0:09:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Shido Itsuka, your future husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.03,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm gonna make your body... crave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.78,0:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido Itsuka, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.49,0:10:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How are her levels looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No changes across the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Levels are so flat, it's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.63,0:10:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your goal? Why did you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.09,0:10:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I go around trying\Nto help Spirits like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ratatoskr?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There are nine others like Muku\Nwhom you've already helped?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. So can you come to the surface\Nand let me seal your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,While I understand your objective,\NMuku does not need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm content floating up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:11:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But DEM might come attack you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.22,0:11:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That scrap metal? Come as they may,\Nthey're hardly an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.06,0:11:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But the surface is lots of fun.\NIt's sad up here by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not an issue. Muku doesn't feel sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to act tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that.\NMuku doesn't feel loneliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor sadness, anger, excitement,\Ndelight, joy, nor love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Muku has locked her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Locked... your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.72,0:11:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why? It was so long ago,\Nit's hard to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Muku wants for nothing to touch her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Muku's here,\Nwhere no one can reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's... But that's so sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Come down to Earth\Nso you can be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.08,0:12:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to decide\Nwhat makes Muku happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there are Spirits you've saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But Muku is Muku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposing you seal my power,\Ncan you guarantee Muku will be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Would not the Spirits you "save"\Nbe exposed to greater peril?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, I tire hearing of this hypocrisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If people don't learn to leave\NMuku alone, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall use Michael\Nto stop this planet's spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.29,0:12:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Shido. May we not meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.79,0:12:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Segva.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The image was cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The camera's not responding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.22,0:13:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're that depressed\Nover getting shot down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand her view.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If not for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,some Spirits might've had\Nbetter futures and be better off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't forget:\NSpirits cause huge disasters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.24,0:13:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A power that dangerous looming above us\Nis something we can't ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we leave her alone,\Nshe won't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.50,0:13:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we don't, what about DEM?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If DEM beats Mukuro,\NWestcott will gain her power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And if they fail,\NMukuro will devastate the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice but to seal\NMukuro's powers before DEM gets her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I guess we've gotta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? What are they saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Request. Stop pushing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh! They'll hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. Sorry. We didn't mean to eavesdrop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.63,0:14:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize! In fact, it's only\Nnatural we're worried about Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We may have overheard a little.\NIs there any way we can help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just one option:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Use her Angel to open\Nthe very same heart she closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,\Nuse Michael on Mukuro again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I see! But we can't do that\Nwithout going to her in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.03,0:14:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.95,0:14:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What good timing.\NThere's something I wanna show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fraxinus' bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.34,0:15:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's different than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.13,0:15:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. It's a new model with\Neverything upgraded: Fraxinus Excelsior!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Space is a cakewalk for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.81,0:15:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Fraxinus. How goes it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Kotori. It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.69,0:15:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.15,0:15:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Were I a Spirit,\Nmy happiness would drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.07,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fraxinus' AI. The upgrades\Nmade it able to converse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My call sign is MARIA. It's a pleasure\Nto work with you again, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's a pleasure, MARIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.88,0:15:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So? How long till we can depart, MARIA?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Roughly 90 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've restored everyone's customizations,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:16:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but please confirm them individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.23,0:16:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,--Roger!\N--Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, please limit personal goods\Nbrought on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You do not need straw dolls\Nor anime figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You never complained before!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I couldn't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, please refrain from\Ncalling ex-wives and call girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--Eh?!\N--Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.37,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cameras are not to be used\Nto spy on past lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.42,0:16:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys were using\NFraxinus for such things?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.22,0:16:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,--No!\N--As if!\N--We'd never!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.01,0:16:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, an on-base visitor\Nis asking for a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Meeting?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chairman Elliot Woodman.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.02,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, the name rings no bells.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.41,0:16:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember! You asked for directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to reintroduce myself:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Elliot Baldwin Woodman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori? Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.55,0:17:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the chairman of Ratatoskr's\Ndecision-making round table.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's it's head and founder.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido Itsuka, you have my thanks.\NThank you for saving so many Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, thank you.\NWithout Ratatoskr, I'd get nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got questions.\NFirst off, Elliot Baldwin Woodman...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That is you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me: As one of DEM's\Nfounding members,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,what's your goal behind saving\NSpirits, when 30 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:18:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it was you who first manifested them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They manifested... Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.56,0:18:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't manifested\NSpirits and made DEM,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have had\Nto go through all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you plotting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You have the power\Nto look up anything, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have done so to me long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I never meant to hide anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I founded DEM along with\NIsaac Westcott and Ellen Mathers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,hoping to utilize the power of Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But laying eyes upon the Spirit of Origin\Nchanged me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I left DEM with Karen Mathers here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,who felt the same as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.27,0:18:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mathers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:19:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She is Ellen Mathers' little sister,\Nthough Ellen looks like the younger one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I dedicated my life\Nto the protection of Spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,despite making enemies of Ike and Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.88,0:19:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Love. Love happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I saw the Spirit of Origin,\Nshe stole my heart away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.56,0:19:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I can't stand seeing\Nother Spirits like her in pain--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,as silly a reason as it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.49,0:19:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm kinda glad Ratatoskr\Nwas founded by someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Sorry, but can I get\Na better look at your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. You look like the boy after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency! Confirming DEM airship above!\NWe're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding! How did they find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Beelzebub!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Itsuka, take the Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I deal with things here,\NI'll escape another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.97,0:20:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that. Stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:21:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of the Spirits, Shido Itsuka.\NAnd please, save Zodiac.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.11,0:21:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how many enemies are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, so let's hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.67,0:21:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Westcott...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally tracked down\NElliot and you guys show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lovely to see you again,\Nbut I need you bunch to behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.35,0:21:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play with you after Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.74,0:21:55.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 04:\N'Space Spirit.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.59,0:23:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time,\Nthere was a man named Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who awaits Shido, Momotaro,\Nand Little Red Riding Hood at the ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.26,0:23:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Fairy Tale."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:41.54,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 04: 'Fairy Tale.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The emperor has no clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,
